  "answer": "The DHCP offer is broadcast when the client sets the BROADCAST bit in its DHCPDISCOVER or DHCPREQUEST messages, indicating it cannot receive unicast IP datagrams before being configured with an IP address. Otherwise, the offer is unicast.",
